AB  - With the rapid development of artificial intelligence technology, its application in the field of education and teaching is becoming increasingly widespread, bringing revolutionary changes to traditional education models. To cultivate high-quality software vocational skills talents, a digital management platform based on AI+capability model is constructed to explore the innovative application of artificial intelligence in education and teaching, realizing intelligent auxiliary learning functions such as personalized resource recommendation, student growth monitoring, and achievement label portrait. At the same time, a series of intelligent teaching tools such as”AI+Code Generation, AI+Inspection Assistant, AI+Process Map” will be developed to explore and promote the vertical application of big models in talent cultivation. Through innovative models such as”introducing enterprises into education, cultivating students through real-life situations, AI+empowerment, teaching according to students’ aptitude, trinity, innovative training, strengthening processes, and diverse evaluations”, it has been fully applied to the talent training scene of software technology field engineers, and its teaching effectiveness is significant. © 2024 Copyright held by the owner/author(s).
