AB  - Generative AI transforms the landscape of software engineering, enabling automation, creativity, and efficiency throughout development. By leveraging advanced machine learning models, like large language models and code generation tools, developers can automate code generation, streamline testing, and design software architectures. This shift accelerates development timelines and redefines the roles of engineers and the skills required in modern software teams. As generative AI evolves, its integration into software engineering raises important questions around reliability, security, and human-AI collaboration. Generative AI in Software Engineering explores the evolving role of generative AI in the software engineering landscape. It examines how AI accelerates software development, reduces costs, and enhances creativity, offering real-world benefits for businesses. This book covers topics such as quantum computing, visual intelligence, and environment science, and is a useful resource for business owners, computer engineers, academicians, researchers, and data scientists. © 2025 by IGI Global Scientific Publishing. All rights reserved.
