AB  - Technical debt has long been a challenge in software engineering, often accumulating due to time constraints, evolving requirements, or inadequate documentation. Generative AI models, particularly large language models (LLMs), offer innovative solutions to reduce technical debt through automated code analysis, refactoring, documentation generation, and dependency management. This chapter explores methodologies, tools, advancements, and case studies demonstrating how generative models can streamline maintenance processes, enhance code quality, and foster sustainable software ecosystems. © 2025, IGI Global Scientific Publishing. All rights reserved.
