TI  - A Multi-Agent Coding Assistant for Cloud-Native Development: From Requirements to Deployable Microservices
PY  - 2026
T2  - Proceedings of 2025 6th International Conference on Computer Science and Management Technology, ICCSMT 2025
SP  - 1285
EP  - 1290
