AB  - Currently, the Large Language Models (LLMs) and autonomous agents are rapidly evolving technologies with the potential to revolutionize a variety of industries. The paper examines the application of autonomous agents in information retrieval using LLMs. Its purpose is to investigate how these technologies can enhance the efficiency, speed, and reliability of fact-finding and question-answering. Paper describes the development idea of information retrieval system utilizing autonomous agents and selected LLMs. © 2025 Copyright held by the owner/author(s).
