TI  - GPIoT: Tailoring Small Language Models for IoT Program Synthesis and Development
PY  - 2025
T2  - ACM SenSys 2025 - 23rd ACM Conference on Embedded Networked Sensor Systems, In Transactions to Conference Embedded Artificial Intelligence and Sensing Systems
SP  - 199
