TI  - StuLAC: An Adaptive LLM-Driven Framework for Scalable Student Feedback Analysis in Software-Driven Educational Systems
PY  - 2025
T2  - Proceedings - 2025 IEEE 49th Annual Computers, Software, and Applications Conference, COMPSAC 2025
SP  - 121
EP  - 130
