AB  - Artificial intelligence(AI) is transforming the software development life cycle by integrating intelligent automation into every stage, from design to maintenance.When combined with DevOps practice, emerging technologies such as generative AI enable fully automated pipeline capable of code generation, error detection, deployment ,and performance monitoring with minimal human intervention. This paper examines how machine learning and predictive analytics enhance software stability ,scalability ,and efficiency with AI argumented DevOps environment. Through a comprehensive review of current research, it highlights the role of deep learning, reinforcement learning, and and large language models(LLMs) in optimising continuous integration and delivery.The study also identify key challenges in explainability, resource optimisation, and cross- platform adaptability. Ultimately this work envisions a future where software systems evolve into self managing, self improving ecosystems driven by continuous learning and intelligent automation © 2025 IEEE.
