TI  - Wired for Reuse: Automating Context-Aware Code Adaptation in IDEs via LLM-Based Agent
PY  - 2025
T2  - Proceedings - 2025 40th IEEE/ACM International Conference on Automated Software Engineering, ASE 2025
SP  - 178
EP  - 190
DO  - 10.1109/ASE63991.2025.00023
