TI  - Assessing ChatGPT's Capability in Extracting Architectural Elements from Software Systems
PY  - 2025
T2  - International Journal of Advances in Soft Computing and its Applications
VL  - 17
IS  - 2
SP  - 209
EP  - 231
DO  - 10.15849/IJASCA.250730.11
