AB  - GitHub Repository Supporter is a high-tech AI solution that helps software engineering teams deal with challenges like managing complex, multi-tiered codebases and working collaboratively from different locations. A lot of the time, regular tools don't do a good job at automating chores or understanding the situation, which renders them useless. Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) and Large Language Models (LLMs) are used by this platform to search for semantic code. This enables developers ask questions about repositories in plain English, so they don't have to pore through the code by hand. It also finds flaws, variables, and functions in the code. It has Whisper ASR to transcribe conference audio and video so that teams can work together better, and Google Gemini AI creates summaries that are organized and time-stamped. It has a modular design that makes it easy to find your way around repositories, write documentation automatically, and collaborate together. This paper talks about the system architecture and AI methodologies, focusing on how intelligent automation may make work more productive and transform the way software is made. © 2025 IEEE.
