TI  - EnergyBench: Holistic Benchmark for Correct and Energy-Efficient LLM-Generated Code
PY  - 2025
T2  - 2025 3rd International Conference on Federated Learning Technologies and Applications, FLTA 2025
SP  - 571
EP  - 579
