TI  - How Does ChatGPT Make Assumptions When Creating Erroneous Programs?
PY  - 2025
T2  - Proceedings - 2025 40th IEEE/ACM International Conference on Automated Software Engineering, ASE 2025
SP  - 3809
EP  - 3813
DO  - 10.1109/ASE63991.2025.00321
