TI  - A Generative AI Framework for Semi-Automated Oracle SQL to BigQuery SQL Code Migration using LLM Driven DAGs and Iterative Refinement
PY  - 2025
T2  - Proceedings of International Conference on Sustainable Communication Networks and Application, ICSCN 2025
SP  - 1855
EP  - 1860
DO  - 10.1109/ICSCN67106.2025.11308271
