TI  - Multi-step Iterative Automated Domain Modeling with Large Language Models
PY  - 2024
T2  - Proceedings: MODELS 2024 - ACM/IEEE 27th International Conference on Model Driven Engineering Languages and Systems: Companion Proceedings
SP  - 587
EP  - 595
DO  - 10.1145/3652620.3687807
