TI  - Can GPT-4 Aid in Detecting Ambiguities, Inconsistencies, and Incompleteness in Requirements Analysis? A Comprehensive Case Study
PY  - 2024
T2  - IEEE Access
VL  - 12
SP  - 171972
EP  - 171992
