AB  - The complexity of data and business content in enterprise software design makes it difficult to grasp, which leads to problems such as low team coding efficiency and easy errors. The key to solving this problem is to take the business data of the enterprise as the center and drive the code development with the characteristics of the data itself. Therefore, this study proposes an automatic front-end code generation method based on data and template integration (GC-DT). This method utilizes the enterprise business table structure and templates to form the process of automatic code generation, and realizes the automatic generation of VUE front-end code. Practical application shows that compared with the traditional method, this method can effectively reduce the workload of software development, shorten the software development cycle, and still effectively maintain the consistency and correctness of the team code in the face of complex content structure. Therefore, this method has high application value in enterprise software development. © 2024 ACM.
