TI  - Nuances are the Key: Unlocking ChatGPT to Find Failure-Inducing Tests with Differential Prompting
PY  - 2023
T2  - Proceedings - 2023 38th IEEE/ACM International Conference on Automated Software Engineering, ASE 2023
SP  - 14
EP  - 26
DO  - 10.1109/ASE56229.2023.00089
