AB  - Code generation can effectively reduce the defect rate in software development. The 5G system adopts a service-based architecture. For various application scenarios, developers need to write a large amount of code according to specifications to realize the construction of different logical networks. This process has a long cycle, low efficiency, and many code vulnerabilities. In response to the above problems, this paper introduces the neural network to map the natural language intentions related to the 5G core network into code. The experimental results show that our system is effective and can learn the grammatical knowledge of the target language.  © 2021 IEEE.
